WEBVTT

01:30.580 --> 01:34.860
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.200 --> 01:37.850
[Episode 18]

01:41.430 --> 01:43.229
Once I showed my true form

01:43.229 --> 01:45.120
they all ran away, scared.

01:45.750 --> 01:47.650
But I didn't mean to.

02:06.070 --> 02:06.840
It's okay.

02:07.640 --> 02:09.400
You were trying to protect everyone.

02:09.400 --> 02:10.860
They all understand that.

02:11.630 --> 02:12.870
Then...

02:13.210 --> 02:15.340
will anyone
still play jianzi with me?

02:16.280 --> 02:16.880
Of course.

02:17.210 --> 02:18.400
I'll play with you.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.870
Aren't you afraid of me?

02:23.950 --> 02:25.079
Let me tell you something.

02:25.079 --> 02:27.740
I know an old demon
who's thousands of years old.

02:28.430 --> 02:29.470
He taught me that

02:29.750 --> 02:31.550
seeing isn't always believing.

02:31.630 --> 02:33.750
Many things need to be felt from here

02:33.750 --> 02:35.079
to be truly understood.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.430
And I can feel that

02:36.910 --> 02:38.360
you're just as kind-hearted

02:38.360 --> 02:39.190
as him.

02:41.360 --> 02:41.960
By the way,

02:42.470 --> 02:44.520
why do you love
playing jianzi so much?

02:44.520 --> 02:45.630
Because of Jin Ge.

02:46.470 --> 02:47.310
Jin Ge?

02:48.240 --> 02:50.190
She's my friend, just like you all.

02:52.560 --> 02:54.430
My mission from heaven

02:54.520 --> 02:58.070
is to guard the Kunlun Mirror fragments
on Mount Qiansui.

02:58.240 --> 03:00.710
I've been guarding this mountain
for thousands of years,

03:00.710 --> 03:02.440
and it's been terribly lonely.

03:02.470 --> 03:03.520
A thousand years ago,

03:03.520 --> 03:07.180
I couldn't resist taking human form
and coming down the mountain.

03:09.870 --> 03:10.400
Throw it to me!

03:10.400 --> 03:10.870
To me!

03:11.430 --> 03:12.160
Pass it here!

03:13.800 --> 03:14.310
To me!

03:15.680 --> 03:16.190
Pass it!

03:16.630 --> 03:17.360
Kick it to me!

03:17.960 --> 03:18.960
Kick it over here!

03:21.750 --> 03:23.320
Can I play with you?

03:23.360 --> 03:24.280
Go away!

03:30.800 --> 03:32.730
That looks fun! Could you teach me?

03:37.310 --> 03:37.910
Line up!

03:39.120 --> 03:39.910
Mount up!

03:39.960 --> 03:41.520
-Go! Go!
-Attack!

03:41.870 --> 03:42.500
Hit him!

03:42.910 --> 03:44.079
-Go!
-Go! Go!

03:44.360 --> 03:45.840
Hit him! Hit him! Hit him!

03:45.870 --> 03:46.560
Get him!

03:49.520 --> 03:51.280
Come on! Come on! Come on!

03:51.280 --> 03:52.030
I don't want to play anymore.

03:52.030 --> 03:52.630
I'm too tired.

03:52.630 --> 03:53.710
I'm always the horse!

03:53.710 --> 03:54.870
I'm always the horse!

03:54.870 --> 03:55.600
I quit.

03:55.750 --> 03:56.680
I'll be the horse!

03:56.680 --> 03:57.400
Let me join you!

03:57.400 --> 03:58.240
Who's this stranger?

03:58.240 --> 03:58.960
Go away!

03:59.960 --> 04:00.470
Come on, come on.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.280
I can do it.

04:01.360 --> 04:01.750
Come.

04:02.030 --> 04:02.590
Line up.

04:02.870 --> 04:03.580
Mount up.

04:03.800 --> 04:04.430
Attack!

04:04.430 --> 04:05.190
Hit him.

04:05.190 --> 04:06.030
Go.

04:06.240 --> 04:06.960
Charge.

04:07.000 --> 04:07.630
Hurry.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.840
Hit him, hit him.

04:08.840 --> 04:09.470
Go.

04:09.710 --> 04:10.150
Attack.

04:10.150 --> 04:11.000
Hit him quickly.

04:11.000 --> 04:11.630
Hurry up.

04:12.030 --> 04:13.150
Hit him now.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.560
Go get him.

04:14.560 --> 04:16.190
Lansheng, dinner's ready!

04:16.190 --> 04:16.950
Time to eat!

04:16.950 --> 04:17.870
Come home for dinner!

04:17.870 --> 04:18.630
Come back now.

04:18.630 --> 04:19.510
Hurry up.

04:20.070 --> 04:20.950
Come back quickly.

04:20.950 --> 04:21.750
Dinner time.

04:52.070 --> 04:52.950
Who are you?

04:55.240 --> 04:56.120
I'm Jin Ge.

04:56.120 --> 04:56.870
And you?

05:01.640 --> 05:03.360
Why are you sad?

05:04.120 --> 05:05.630
Is someone bullying you?

05:07.000 --> 05:08.600
Nobody wants to play with me.

05:09.110 --> 05:10.430
I can play with you.

05:29.870 --> 05:30.480
More.

06:17.040 --> 06:17.900
Are you hidden?

06:18.310 --> 06:19.570
I'm coming to find you!

06:26.040 --> 06:26.800
Found you!

06:30.950 --> 06:32.010
Why are you crying?

06:32.430 --> 06:33.690
Without realizing it,

06:33.920 --> 06:35.430
it's all dark already.

06:36.360 --> 06:38.070
I came here

06:38.190 --> 06:40.920
to find fragments
of the ancient Kunlun Mirror.

06:41.510 --> 06:42.640
If I can't find them,

06:42.870 --> 06:44.870
I won't be able to return.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.590
Then that's perfect!

06:46.590 --> 06:48.190
You can keep playing with me.

06:48.390 --> 06:50.420
But I'll die that way.

06:50.920 --> 06:51.680
Why?

06:52.430 --> 06:54.040
I was originally a mayfly,

06:54.680 --> 06:56.800
with only one day to live.

06:57.950 --> 06:59.600
I never knew what was dawn

07:00.070 --> 07:01.510
or dusk.

07:02.270 --> 07:04.400
After touching a drop of immortal dew,

07:04.510 --> 07:06.570
I accidentally achieved human form.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.870
But my lifespan is only one year,

07:09.600 --> 07:12.310
and 11 months have already passed.

07:12.560 --> 07:14.510
I'll die soon.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.360
Unless...

07:17.360 --> 07:19.290
you can drink from the Yuli Spring?

07:19.950 --> 07:22.120
Since achieving human form,

07:22.480 --> 07:25.360
I've been searching for the fragments
of the ancient Kunlun Mirror.

07:25.360 --> 07:27.800
Only by collecting all the fragments

07:28.240 --> 07:30.560
can I find the Yuli Spring.

07:31.040 --> 07:33.310
I've gathered seven pieces now,

07:33.510 --> 07:35.870
but I can't find the last one.

07:37.270 --> 07:39.360
I'll die soon.

07:45.680 --> 07:47.880
With me here, you absolutely won't die.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.200
Here's the eighth piece.

08:24.680 --> 08:25.870
You are Taotie?

08:25.870 --> 08:26.270
Yes.

08:29.430 --> 08:30.920
Once I find the celestial mountain

08:30.920 --> 08:31.950
and drink from the Yuli Spring,

08:31.950 --> 08:33.789
I'll come back
to play with you right away.

08:33.789 --> 08:34.600
It's a deal.

08:34.960 --> 08:37.080
But what if when I return,

08:37.080 --> 08:38.510
you've already grown up,

08:38.840 --> 08:40.770
and I can't recognize you anymore?

08:43.360 --> 08:44.960
I'll stay looking just like this

08:44.960 --> 08:46.160
and wait for you here.

08:46.740 --> 08:47.150
Okay.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.570
Just see me off here.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.480
You should change your name.

09:02.480 --> 09:03.240
With a new name,

09:03.240 --> 09:05.550
humans will be willing to play with you.

09:06.000 --> 09:06.960
Change to what?

09:08.240 --> 09:09.320
How about Zixiu?

09:10.510 --> 09:10.960
Okay.

09:12.440 --> 09:14.840
Zixiu, practice playing jianzi well.

09:15.120 --> 09:17.050
We'll compete again when I return.

09:17.510 --> 09:18.000
Okay!

09:18.200 --> 09:19.550
Once you become immortal
like heaven and earth,

09:19.550 --> 09:21.670
we can play together forever.

09:21.790 --> 09:22.750
It's a promise.

09:29.150 --> 09:32.210
I gave the ancient mirror
to Jin Ge without permission.

09:32.550 --> 09:33.960
I deserve to be punished,

09:33.960 --> 09:36.630
but I promised I would wait for her here.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.150
So, for a thousand years,

09:38.150 --> 09:40.480
there has only been Zixiu, not Taotie.

09:52.600 --> 09:54.660
You really believe she'll come back?

09:55.080 --> 09:57.600
I promised to wait for her, so I must.

10:00.480 --> 10:02.210
Will you keep waiting forever?

10:02.550 --> 10:03.030
Yes.

10:07.790 --> 10:08.670
But Jin Ge

10:09.440 --> 10:11.630
has already reached the celestial mountain

10:11.630 --> 10:13.360
and drunk from the Yuli Spring.

10:13.750 --> 10:15.280
You know better than anyone

10:15.630 --> 10:17.030
that she won't come back.

10:18.270 --> 10:20.630
I promised to wait for her.

10:24.910 --> 10:28.040
You also came to Mount Qiansui
for the mirror fragments?

10:31.630 --> 10:32.270
Yes.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.690
But there aren't any left here.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.040
It's alright.

10:40.670 --> 10:42.600
Zixiu protected us,

10:42.720 --> 10:44.510
and that's why we survived.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.080
Although we can't stay

10:47.080 --> 10:48.870
and play with you forever,

10:49.120 --> 10:51.120
we can teach you some new games.

10:51.120 --> 10:51.600
Really?

10:51.840 --> 10:52.320
Really.

10:54.270 --> 10:54.910
"We?"

10:58.670 --> 10:59.960
One, two, three,

10:59.960 --> 11:01.030
freeze!

11:02.720 --> 11:04.360
One, two, three, freeze!

11:06.120 --> 11:07.910
One, two, three, freeze!

11:09.360 --> 11:10.840
One, two, three, freeze!

12:21.320 --> 12:22.360
Xiao Yao,

12:23.150 --> 12:24.080
are you scared?

12:24.510 --> 12:25.390
No!

12:25.390 --> 12:26.150
Higher!

12:26.150 --> 12:28.150
Don't let that stinky man touch you!

12:37.120 --> 12:39.630
Higher!

12:42.600 --> 12:43.550
I have to go now.

12:44.510 --> 12:46.170
Thank you for playing with me.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.960
This is the second happiest day

12:48.960 --> 12:50.560
I've had in a thousand years.

12:52.040 --> 12:53.110
The happiest

12:53.270 --> 12:55.080
was the day I met Jin Ge.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.770
But by tomorrow,

12:59.360 --> 13:01.480
today will become the happiest.

13:02.510 --> 13:05.240
Tomorrow will be
exactly one thousand years, right?

13:05.240 --> 13:05.790
Yes.

13:18.480 --> 13:20.350
I can't wait for Jin Ge anymore.

13:21.790 --> 13:22.960
Time's up.

13:25.500 --> 13:27.610
I must go face my punishment now.

13:30.150 --> 13:30.930
Xiao Yao,

13:31.000 --> 13:31.960
if someday

13:32.720 --> 13:34.580
you reach the celestial mountain

13:35.000 --> 13:36.450
and see Jin Ge,

13:36.960 --> 13:37.720
could you

13:38.220 --> 13:39.990
tell her something for me?

13:41.200 --> 13:41.840
Go ahead.

13:43.490 --> 13:48.090
I've gotten even better
at jianzi than before.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.510
I'll definitely tell her.

14:44.030 --> 14:45.690
Isn't the Kunlun Mirror gone?

14:48.510 --> 14:52.310
This fragment must have been left
by Taotie's lingering obsession.

14:55.740 --> 14:57.270
Life has Eight Sufferings:

14:58.030 --> 14:59.790
Birth, Aging, Sickness, Death,

14:59.790 --> 15:00.990
Love and Separation,

15:01.120 --> 15:02.320
Lasting Resentment,

15:02.480 --> 15:05.340
Unattainable Desire,
and Unresolved Attachment.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.580
This must be his Unresolved Attachment.

15:21.600 --> 15:23.700
Everyone says Taotie was vicious,

15:24.550 --> 15:27.350
but he actually sealed himself
in such a small form

15:27.550 --> 15:28.790
for one thousand years

15:28.790 --> 15:30.390
so Jin Ge could recognize him

15:31.570 --> 15:33.420
when she returned.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.100
That Jin Ge...

15:37.100 --> 15:38.170
I've heard

15:38.790 --> 15:41.450
that a thousand years ago,
Dreamshard gathered

15:41.950 --> 15:43.880
the fragments of the Kunlun Mirror

15:44.360 --> 15:47.080
to save someone she loved.
Jin Ge must be her incarnation,

15:47.080 --> 15:50.410
who tricked Taotie
and took the mirror fragment he guarded.

15:53.750 --> 15:54.960
Oh, Zixiu...

15:58.350 --> 16:00.280
Did she manage to save her lover?

16:00.310 --> 16:02.360
It was just a trap set by her lover.

16:03.030 --> 16:03.840
His purpose

16:04.120 --> 16:05.850
was to obtain the Kunlun Mirror

16:06.480 --> 16:08.410
and claim credit from the emperor.

16:08.630 --> 16:10.440
After Dreamshard learned the truth,

16:10.440 --> 16:12.670
she melted her heart into a crystal heart,

16:12.670 --> 16:14.200
transformed into a spirit,

16:14.750 --> 16:17.010
and killed the traitor's entire family.

16:17.670 --> 16:20.130
Only then did she
transcend the Three Realms

16:20.360 --> 16:22.490
and create this Realm of Mist and Void.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.360
How pitiful.

16:30.790 --> 16:31.450
Therefore,

16:32.720 --> 16:34.180
when you meet Dreamshard,

16:35.030 --> 16:36.230
don't make any moves.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.290
Just observe quietly.

16:39.210 --> 16:40.480
What are you planning to do?

16:40.480 --> 16:41.210
Don't worry.

16:41.670 --> 16:42.750
No matter what I do,

16:43.030 --> 16:44.230
it won't involve you.

16:44.390 --> 16:45.920
Don't do anything foolish.

16:52.320 --> 16:53.510
I know my limits.

17:32.710 --> 17:34.880
We have retrieved the mirror fragment.

17:34.880 --> 17:36.740
Please appear before us, My Lord.

17:39.440 --> 17:41.570
I can't believe you actually found it.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.200
I hope you

17:46.920 --> 17:48.250
will keep your promise.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.430
Tan'er and Pianpian...

17:51.240 --> 17:52.570
Which one do you choose?

17:53.080 --> 17:53.920
Tan'er!

17:56.920 --> 17:57.960
Before you left,

17:58.440 --> 17:59.830
you kept saying

17:59.830 --> 18:01.720
you wanted to
restore Lu Pianpian's appearance

18:01.720 --> 18:03.320
in exchange for her freedom.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.860
But now that you returned,

18:05.110 --> 18:07.160
you only think of your own sister.

18:10.270 --> 18:11.270
I beg you, My Lord.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.120
Please release Tan'er.

18:13.750 --> 18:15.030
My sister and I

18:15.030 --> 18:17.960
are willing to collect
all mirror fragments for you.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.070
Tan'er!

18:31.460 --> 18:33.190
Is she willing to listen to you?

18:36.270 --> 18:36.920
Tan'er,

18:37.550 --> 18:39.960
I've voluntarily pledged allegiance
to the Immortal Lord.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.620
You must behave yourself too.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.240
Please, My Lord,

18:52.510 --> 18:54.000
examine the mirror fragment

18:54.000 --> 18:55.460
as proof of our sincerity.

19:42.520 --> 19:43.110
Tan'er,

19:43.270 --> 19:43.750
hurry!

20:01.590 --> 20:02.350
Xiao Yao,

20:03.480 --> 20:04.900
help me take Tan'er

20:05.400 --> 20:06.920
and Pianpian away.

20:15.640 --> 20:16.230
Dali!

20:18.270 --> 20:19.510
How foolish.

20:21.680 --> 20:24.200
You think I couldn't see through

20:24.790 --> 20:26.480
your suicide attack strategy?

20:26.480 --> 20:27.110
Xiao Yao.

20:28.920 --> 20:29.480
Dali!

20:32.570 --> 20:33.910
Die!

21:05.410 --> 21:06.040
Dali.

21:06.780 --> 21:07.310
Xiao Yao.

21:07.310 --> 21:08.920
Why is it you?

21:12.070 --> 21:12.720
Perhaps

21:13.350 --> 21:16.060
from the moment I chose the Immortal Lord,

21:16.790 --> 21:18.590
the ending was already decided.

21:21.680 --> 21:22.510
Xiao Yao.

21:25.170 --> 21:26.830
Am I beautiful?

21:29.510 --> 21:31.400
You are the most beautiful.

21:32.550 --> 21:34.280
You're the most beautiful one.

21:34.830 --> 21:35.550
Go back...

21:38.350 --> 21:39.680
and tell Luoluo

21:40.160 --> 21:40.920
that

21:41.960 --> 21:43.120
I'm cultivating

21:43.750 --> 21:44.880
somewhere far away.

21:46.720 --> 21:47.400
Dali.

21:51.920 --> 21:52.790
Dali!

22:36.510 --> 22:37.310
Xiao Yao,

22:37.920 --> 22:40.180
you're the one who made her feel inferior

22:40.440 --> 22:41.830
and crave attention.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.490
The one who truly killed her

22:44.950 --> 22:45.600
is you.

22:45.950 --> 22:48.010
It's because you don't trust anyone.

22:48.350 --> 22:51.150
That's why
there's no one trustworthy around you.

22:52.880 --> 22:54.010
You do trust people,

22:55.510 --> 22:56.840
but the person you trust

22:57.070 --> 22:58.600
won't wait for you anymore.

23:01.590 --> 23:02.270
Hong Ye,

23:03.510 --> 23:04.110
come out.

23:26.030 --> 23:28.090
Thank you for your kindness, My Lord.

23:30.350 --> 23:33.080
How have you been feeling these days,
Demon King?

23:33.360 --> 23:34.470
I'm grateful to you

23:34.570 --> 23:36.770
for curing my Heart-Devouring Poison.

23:37.260 --> 23:39.520
I've been feeling refreshed these days.

23:40.000 --> 23:42.260
Looking back at my former obsession now,

23:42.480 --> 23:44.350
it seems utterly absurd.

23:45.720 --> 23:47.100
Your poison is cured?

23:48.400 --> 23:49.350
The Demon King found out

23:49.350 --> 23:51.000
you eloped with a Feiyu Guard

23:51.110 --> 23:52.370
and became depressed.

23:52.960 --> 23:55.950
He no longer wanted to endure
that Heart-Devouring pain.

23:55.950 --> 23:57.020
Thus, he begged me

23:57.490 --> 23:58.820
to detoxify him.

24:04.510 --> 24:07.440
I won't keep making mistakes
for someone so selfish.

24:08.830 --> 24:12.560
The Immortal Lord has detoxified me
of the Heart-Devouring Poison

24:13.510 --> 24:15.710
and planted the luan and phoenix for me.

24:16.110 --> 24:18.230
From now on, my heart is the luan.

24:18.660 --> 24:20.520
The Immortal Lord is the phoenix.

24:21.110 --> 24:22.570
Our hearts are connected.

24:23.170 --> 24:24.590
We'll share weal and woe.

24:27.440 --> 24:28.240
Hong Ye,

24:29.470 --> 24:31.400
do you have unspoken difficulties?

24:31.400 --> 24:33.270
Is it her illusion tricking you?

24:33.270 --> 24:33.960
Shut up!

24:36.480 --> 24:37.340
Immortal Lord,

24:38.750 --> 24:39.640
let her go.

24:41.240 --> 24:42.830
Don't let her disturb us.

24:50.640 --> 24:53.120
Do you really have no feelings for her?

25:03.990 --> 25:05.360
Your heart is in pain.

25:10.440 --> 25:11.900
You still can't let her go.

25:28.750 --> 25:31.550
I tried to suppress
this Heart-Devouring Poison,

25:32.400 --> 25:34.550
but you still sensed it.

25:38.340 --> 25:39.300
Let her go.

25:40.960 --> 25:43.420
I will find
all the mirror fragments for you.

25:46.480 --> 25:47.990
What if I don't let her go?

25:54.680 --> 25:55.240
Xiao Yao,

25:55.960 --> 25:56.480
run!

25:57.590 --> 25:58.390
I won't leave.

25:58.640 --> 25:59.160
Hurry!

26:19.590 --> 26:20.750
This is madness.

26:49.200 --> 26:49.680
Xiao Yao

26:49.880 --> 26:50.480
Xiao Yao,

26:50.920 --> 26:52.750
Hong Ye is reciting
the Heart-Burning Incantation.

26:52.750 --> 26:55.240
This spell concentrates all power
into the heart meridian.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.920
The heart meridian will rupture.

26:56.920 --> 26:58.400
Since the Luan-Phoenix Poison
creates a symbiotic link,

26:58.400 --> 26:59.550
the Dreamshard Immortal's heart

26:59.550 --> 27:01.150
will also shatter into dust.

27:03.200 --> 27:04.720
Hong Ye, stop it now!

27:06.400 --> 27:07.000
Xiao Yao.

27:07.110 --> 27:07.790
Hong Ye!

27:07.880 --> 27:08.600
Leave now!

27:08.920 --> 27:09.720
No!

27:10.400 --> 27:11.290
Hong Ye!

27:11.510 --> 27:13.640
You think this little pain can harm me?

27:14.030 --> 27:15.560
The suffering I've endured

27:15.720 --> 27:17.720
is countless times worse than this.

27:21.370 --> 27:22.240
Hong Ye!

27:24.160 --> 27:25.750
Stop it now!

27:25.880 --> 27:26.640
Xiao Yao!

27:28.160 --> 27:28.790
Hurry!

27:43.000 --> 27:43.550
Hong Ye!

27:46.880 --> 27:47.790
Hong Ye!

28:00.750 --> 28:02.410
In this Realm of Mist and Void,

28:03.070 --> 28:04.960
the only one who can control my fate

28:04.960 --> 28:06.030
is myself.

28:06.880 --> 28:07.720
Dreamshard!

28:08.560 --> 28:11.220
Why have you driven us to this point?

28:11.590 --> 28:12.240
Xiao Yao,

28:13.640 --> 28:14.880
I just want to tell you

28:15.790 --> 28:17.250
to stop fooling yourself.

28:18.400 --> 28:20.130
Hong Ye's sincerity toward you

28:21.030 --> 28:22.240
doesn't mean that everyone

28:22.240 --> 28:23.410
is sincere to you.

28:26.480 --> 28:28.010
Who's fooling themselves?

28:29.150 --> 28:31.640
Is it me or you?

28:33.070 --> 28:34.870
In flower sea, there's one bloom

28:35.830 --> 28:37.090
that's never watered,

28:37.580 --> 28:39.110
yet covered in morning dew.

28:40.320 --> 28:41.650
If I'm not mistaken,

28:43.020 --> 28:46.480
that's the true heart you discarded
before becoming a spirit.

28:50.480 --> 28:51.790
I haven't watered you yet.

28:51.790 --> 28:53.850
But why do you already have dew on you?

28:54.920 --> 28:56.520
Where did your dew come from?

28:59.420 --> 29:02.150
Among the thousands of flowers
in the flower sea,

29:02.680 --> 29:04.580
why are you the most special one?

29:04.980 --> 29:07.690
You must have been a crybaby
when you were human.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.090
The dew on the flower

29:11.670 --> 29:13.920
must be your unresolved tears.

29:15.510 --> 29:17.270
You created all these trials

29:18.430 --> 29:19.400
just to prove that

29:19.400 --> 29:21.660
true feelings
still exist in this world.

29:23.610 --> 29:26.340
But there's someone
who has been waiting for you,

29:26.680 --> 29:28.550
yet you chose to ignore him.

29:34.270 --> 29:35.030
Who?

29:36.640 --> 29:37.480
Taotie.

29:39.620 --> 29:41.880
He waited for Jin Ge
for a thousand years,

29:42.440 --> 29:44.100
without complaint or regret.

29:45.790 --> 29:47.000
Jin Ge is gone.

29:48.400 --> 29:50.330
She went away a thousand years ago.

29:50.400 --> 29:51.790
Jin Ge never left.

29:52.400 --> 29:53.240
She just wrapped herself

29:53.240 --> 29:54.960
in a hard shell.

30:07.110 --> 30:08.970
Now I've brought what you wanted.

30:10.830 --> 30:14.030
I've also proven
the true feelings you didn't believe in.

30:14.070 --> 30:16.350
You can take my life easily.

30:19.920 --> 30:22.510
But being able to die with the one I love,

30:24.160 --> 30:25.550
I have no regrets.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.580
I don't need anyone's sincerity.

30:37.480 --> 30:40.310
Taotie has one more message for Jin Ge.

30:41.880 --> 30:42.680
He said

30:43.880 --> 30:45.310
his jianzi skills now

30:46.000 --> 30:48.960
are even better than Jin Ge's were before.

30:59.270 --> 31:00.110
Jin Ge!

31:03.650 --> 31:05.030
Your appearance has changed,

31:05.030 --> 31:06.640
but I still recognize you.

31:09.720 --> 31:11.270
Do you remember me?

31:14.790 --> 31:16.350
Xiao Yao must have told you

31:16.640 --> 31:19.570
that my jianzi skills
are better than yours were.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.780
Would you like to compete with me?

31:41.990 --> 31:43.430
♪ I still remember the light ♪

31:44.200 --> 31:46.080
♪ In your eyes that night ♪

31:48.910 --> 31:50.730
♪ It lit up all the most beautiful lies ♪

31:51.320 --> 31:53.310
♪ I've ever seen ♪

31:53.270 --> 31:54.070
You really

31:54.160 --> 31:57.680
♪ The silence and heat of the moonlight ♪

31:54.950 --> 31:56.360
never hated me?

31:56.480 --> 31:57.350
Of course not.

31:57.350 --> 31:58.510
I will always remember

31:58.110 --> 32:00.080
♪ Fall on my shoulder ♪

31:58.510 --> 32:01.190
that was my happiest day
in a thousand years.

32:02.340 --> 32:04.050
♪ The galaxy ♪

32:05.090 --> 32:07.070
♪ Flow on my fingers ♪

32:08.030 --> 32:11.660
♪ Those unrevealed wishes ♪

32:13.210 --> 32:17.760
♪ My heartbeat is hiding,
only the wind is shaking ♪

32:19.100 --> 32:22.240
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

32:23.440 --> 32:26.110
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

32:23.710 --> 32:25.360
No one wants to play with me.

32:25.810 --> 32:27.240
I can play with you.

32:26.830 --> 32:27.960
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

32:28.760 --> 32:32.230
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

32:33.270 --> 32:36.160
♪ The youth is endless ♪

32:37.020 --> 32:39.560
♪ Love grows in time ♪

32:40.730 --> 32:47.720
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

32:40.830 --> 32:43.180
Zixiu, you must practice playing jianzi,

32:43.470 --> 32:45.270
and we'll compete when I return.

32:45.920 --> 32:46.310
Okay.

32:46.510 --> 32:47.830
When you become immortal
like the heaven and earth,

32:47.830 --> 32:49.930
we can play together forever.

32:50.200 --> 32:51.030
It's a deal.

33:01.580 --> 33:02.860
♪ We stare at each other ♪

33:03.650 --> 33:05.700
♪ And forget how long it has been ♪

33:03.790 --> 33:06.410
This world isn't truly without feeling

33:07.270 --> 33:07.960
or trust.

33:08.430 --> 33:10.250
♪ All I want is this moment's bloom ♪

33:08.790 --> 33:09.590
Xiao Yao,

33:10.790 --> 33:11.880
you were right.

33:10.960 --> 33:12.840
♪ Grow freely ♪

33:13.790 --> 33:17.060
♪ The stars in your eyes
are the only place ♪

33:17.760 --> 33:19.620
♪ In the distance that I can see ♪

33:22.110 --> 33:23.470
♪ Don't think about ♪

33:24.110 --> 33:25.480
All things in the world

33:24.620 --> 33:26.520
♪ Whether we end in a farewell or not ♪

33:27.350 --> 33:28.830
eventually come to an end.

33:27.750 --> 33:31.020
♪ Those unrevealed wishes ♪

33:32.600 --> 33:37.160
♪ My heartbeat is hiding,
only the wind is shaking ♪

33:39.070 --> 33:42.200
♪ The stars fall into the sea ♪

33:43.070 --> 33:45.510
♪ Light up the light in your eyes ♪

33:46.370 --> 33:47.470
♪ The lies at this moment ♪

33:48.290 --> 33:51.510
♪ Are so beautiful it's ridiculous ♪

33:52.720 --> 33:55.710
♪ The youth is endless ♪

33:56.520 --> 33:59.130
♪ Love grows in time ♪

34:00.030 --> 34:07.320
♪ You are the old wound in my palm ♪

34:07.720 --> 34:08.800
Why did I change back?

34:08.800 --> 34:09.929
What's happening?

34:10.280 --> 34:11.710
Why is it like this now?

34:14.550 --> 34:15.949
What on earth is going on?

34:16.070 --> 34:17.630
Did the Immortal Lord die?

34:17.630 --> 34:18.360
How dare you!

34:19.230 --> 34:21.560
Such slander will get your tongue cut out.

35:02.920 --> 35:03.670
Hong Ye.

35:05.630 --> 35:06.360
Hong Ye.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.150
Hong Ye, wake up.

35:10.510 --> 35:11.960
You're the Demon King.

35:13.800 --> 35:15.760
You'll be fine, won't you?

35:16.670 --> 35:17.590
Hong Ye!

35:18.320 --> 35:19.030
Hong Ye!

35:19.550 --> 35:21.550
Don't scare me, Hong Ye.

35:22.800 --> 35:24.510
You're shaking me to death.

35:28.880 --> 35:29.590
Hong Ye!

35:37.480 --> 35:38.320
I knew it.

35:39.150 --> 35:40.680
You wouldn't die so easily.

35:50.840 --> 35:52.970
I haven't taken you
to see scenic views

35:53.440 --> 35:54.900
or explored the world yet.

35:55.490 --> 35:57.240
How could I leave so easily?

36:00.150 --> 36:00.670
Yes.

36:03.400 --> 36:04.710
Xiao Yao.

36:06.800 --> 36:08.760
My duty is finished.

36:09.150 --> 36:11.790
Will you say goodbye to me?

36:12.040 --> 36:13.180
Little Leaf.

36:24.870 --> 36:25.970
Little Leaf.

36:29.320 --> 36:30.110
Xiao Yao.

36:31.760 --> 36:33.090
Kiss me,

36:33.800 --> 36:36.160
and I'll forget all the bad things.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.400
This one is

37:45.110 --> 37:46.370
Unattainable Desire?

37:46.400 --> 37:47.070
Indeed.

37:48.360 --> 37:49.890
These two mirror fragments

37:50.400 --> 37:52.600
should return to their rightful owner.

37:55.800 --> 37:56.930
A hundred years ago,

37:57.360 --> 38:00.230
the former emperor gathered
all fragments of the Kunlun Mirror,

38:00.230 --> 38:01.670
but before he could
find the celestial mountain,

38:01.670 --> 38:03.270
the Demon King destroyed it.

38:03.760 --> 38:06.030
Now that the ancient Kunlun Mirror
has reappeared,

38:06.030 --> 38:08.760
it should return to
the current emperor's hands.

38:10.190 --> 38:13.110
Do you know that the ancient Kunlun Mirror
from a hundred years ago

38:13.110 --> 38:15.250
was obtained by your so-called
former emperor

38:15.250 --> 38:17.160
through despicable means?

38:18.800 --> 38:20.330
A hundred years have passed

38:21.030 --> 38:22.760
and it's still the same.

38:23.320 --> 38:25.580
He's unable to disregard life and death,

38:26.230 --> 38:28.030
all because of greed.

38:28.030 --> 38:29.320
How dare you!

38:31.800 --> 38:32.630
-Stop!
-Xiao Yao, get out of the way!

38:32.630 --> 38:34.000
-Xiao Yao!
-What are you doing?

38:34.000 --> 38:36.130
Assembling the ancient Kunlun Mirror

38:36.480 --> 38:38.000
and eliminating the Demon King

38:38.000 --> 38:39.400
are His Majesty's direct orders

38:39.400 --> 38:41.130
and the duty of the Feiyu Guard.

38:42.510 --> 38:44.000
He sacrificed the lives of a hundred women

38:44.000 --> 38:45.550
to gain immortality for himself.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.480
Do you think such a person

38:46.480 --> 38:48.440
truly deserves your blind obedience?

38:48.440 --> 38:49.760
I only follow orders.

38:49.880 --> 38:50.920
I cannot defy the imperial decree.

38:50.920 --> 38:51.920
Imperial decree?

38:52.400 --> 38:53.670
If it weren't for the imperial decree,

38:53.670 --> 38:56.480
why would Tan'er
have been driven to such desperation?

38:56.480 --> 38:57.960
Now, you only care about imperial orders

38:57.960 --> 39:00.290
and have lost
all sense of right and wrong.

39:01.800 --> 39:02.510
Tan'er,

39:03.320 --> 39:06.250
do you also think
what your brother is doing is right?

39:23.000 --> 39:24.200
This mirror fragment

39:24.590 --> 39:26.050
has nothing to do with you.

39:26.550 --> 39:28.000
And the one in your hand

39:28.000 --> 39:29.660
wasn't obtained by you alone.

39:34.760 --> 39:36.360
If you really want to take it,

39:36.840 --> 39:39.030
either kill us both right now

39:39.840 --> 39:40.400
or

39:40.800 --> 39:42.630
wait until everyone has recovered

39:42.630 --> 39:43.960
and you two can have

39:43.960 --> 39:44.840
a fair contest.

39:56.710 --> 39:57.440
Fine.

40:00.320 --> 40:01.380
If that's the case,

40:02.550 --> 40:04.080
these two mirror fragments

40:04.510 --> 40:06.440
shall be in your keeping.

40:07.190 --> 40:09.050
When all fragments are gathered,

40:09.710 --> 40:11.070
I will take them back.

40:22.190 --> 40:22.760
Hong Ye.

40:24.740 --> 40:26.590
For what happened
in the Realm of Mist and Void,

40:26.590 --> 40:28.360
I owe you a favor.

40:29.950 --> 40:31.420
But between us,

40:32.430 --> 40:35.030
there will eventually be
a battle to the death.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.800
Go back and focus on your cultivation.

40:43.960 --> 40:45.190
The Demon Slayer has returned!

40:45.190 --> 40:46.320
The Demon Slayer has returned!

40:46.320 --> 40:47.150
What's wrong?

40:47.630 --> 40:48.510
Is he injured?

40:49.480 --> 40:50.150
What happened to him?

40:50.150 --> 40:50.960
I don't know.

40:53.110 --> 40:53.960
Is he alright?

40:53.960 --> 40:55.520
Can we go home now?

40:55.590 --> 40:56.070
Yes.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.260
The Dreamshard Immortal...

41:01.110 --> 41:02.360
She has been killed.

41:04.760 --> 41:06.880
We knew you're brave

41:06.880 --> 41:08.280
and would keep us safe.

41:08.360 --> 41:09.960
Throughout this perilous journey,

41:09.960 --> 41:11.400
it was thanks to you, My Lord,

41:11.400 --> 41:12.670
that we could survive.

41:12.840 --> 41:14.150
Please, My Lord,

41:14.590 --> 41:16.480
take us to reunite
with our families quickly.

41:16.480 --> 41:17.760
Yes, take us home.

41:17.760 --> 41:18.320
My Lord.

41:18.320 --> 41:18.990
Let's prepare to go home.

41:18.990 --> 41:19.880
Please take us back soon.

41:19.880 --> 41:21.340
-Okay.
-We can go home now.

41:21.800 --> 41:23.000
We can finally go home.

41:23.000 --> 41:24.260
We can finally return.

41:26.440 --> 41:28.700
My Lord, are you looking for Lu Pianpian?

41:30.110 --> 41:31.840
She's with Zhirui and Pei.
